// Matcher: the C++ matching engine as a gRPC service.
//
// Prices cross the wire as integer ticks, never floats. The adapter converts
// decimal prices to ticks exactly; the engine works in whole ticks.
//
// State lives in sessions. OpenSession creates a fresh, isolated set of order
// books and returns its id; every Submit names its session. A session that
// disappears (engine restart, eviction) makes Submit fail with NOT_FOUND, and
// the adapter rebuilds by replaying the orders topic into a new session.

